\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 I'm assuming the 5 string outputs on channel 1 add together.\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 I'm assuming 
\f1\fs26 mc.stereo~
\f0\fs24  exists in your Max.\
